&lt;p&gt;Craft code that meets our&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.gitlab.com/development/contributing/style_guides/&quot;&gt; internal standards&lt;/a&gt; for style, maintainability, and best practices for a high-scale web environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Conduct code reviews within our&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.gitlab.com/development/code_review/&quot;&gt; Code Review Guidelines&lt;/a&gt; and ensure community contributions receive a swift response&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
